commit 0ca07bf6
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-24 07:24:22 -0600
subject: fix(i18n): rewrite Chinese literals in dashboard + add eslint guard-rail

- model-context/page.js: 48 Chinese strings → English source text

- statistics/StatisticsContent.js: 11 Chinese strings → English source text

- Header.js: special-case /media-providers/web for properly-capitalized title

- zh-CN.json +63 keys (1514 total), zh-TW.json +71 keys (266 total), re-sorted

- endpointConstants.js: wrap intentional wenyan presets in eslint-disable

- eslint.config.mjs: add local-i18n/no-chinese-literals rule scoped to dashboard tree

Resolves Finding #12 (Model Context + Statistics), Finding #15 item 1 (web heading).


